Writing – Original Draft, Writing – Review &amp; Editing.
<span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Elie Raad</span>: Writing – Review &amp; Editing.
<span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Beatrice Gamba</span>: Writing – Review &amp; Editing.
<span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">David Riccitelli</span>: Software, Writing – Review &amp; Editing.
The authors used Antigravity to assist with the research and the writing to
improve clarity and readability. All content was carefully reviewed and
