</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Note: <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_note"><a href="https://github.com/google/adk-python" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/google/adk-python</a></span>
