<section id="Pt0.A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.2 </span>Agentic RAG System Instruction</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following system instruction is provided to the Google ADK agent in
conditions C4–C6 (agentic RAG). The agent uses this instruction to plan
its tool-calling strategy:</p>
</div>
