<section id="Pt0.A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.3 </span>LLM Judge Prompts</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Three evaluation prompts are used by the independent judge model
(Gemini 3 Flash Preview). All judge calls request JSON output via
<span id="Pt0.A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">response_mime_type="application/json"</span>.</p>
</div>
