<section id="Pt0.A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.A.4 </span>Enhanced Entity Page Template</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The enhanced entity page template (Jinja2) used for condition C3 and C6
documents. Key features: Schema.org type breadcrumbs, embedded JSON-LD,
visible linked entity navigation with content negotiation instructions,
and <span id="Pt0.A1.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">llms.txt</span>-style agent instructions.</p>
</div>
<div id="Pt0.A1.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="Pt0.A1.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_HTML ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx102" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx102.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_tag ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">&lt;!DOCTYPE<span id="lstnumberx102.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>html&gt;</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx103" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx103.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_tag ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">&lt;html<span id="lstnumberx103.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>lang=<span id="lstnumberx103.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_string">"en"</span></span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx104" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx104.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="lstnumberx104.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">prefix=</span><span id="lstnumberx104.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_string ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">"schema:<span id="lstnumberx104.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">␣</span>http://schema.org/"</span><span id="lstnumberx104.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">&gt;</span>
</div>
